    <entry_item>
      <dico>Boberg</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠣᠩᠭᠠᠭᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>tungγaγaqu</uighur>
      <definition>v.t. To filter, to strain.  To settle and clear water. To separate the muddy water from the pure.</definition>
      <page>979</page>
